OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785111491
OL,3,CMet Police investigate donations by
OL,4,CRichard Tice company to Reform UK
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police are
OL,7,Finvestigating donations to Reform UK
OL,8,Fby a company controlled by the party's
OL,9,Fdeputy leader Richard Tice.
OL,11,FBritain Means Business ` a fundraising
OL,12,Fvehicle ` gave Reform two donations of
OL,13,F#250,000 in the run-up to the 2024
OL,14,Fgeneral election, according to The
OL,15,FSunday Times.
OL,17,FThe money was paid to his company by
OL,18,FReform donor Fiona Cottrell, Tice has
OL,19,Fpreviously outlined.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
