OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785111491
OL,3,CMet Police investigate donations by
OL,4,CRichard Tice company to Reform UK
OL,6,FShe is said to have given #1 million
OL,7,Fto Britain Means Business in June
OL,8,F2024, and half of that money was then
OL,9,Fgiven to Reform.
OL,11,FAs first reported by the BBC, police
OL,12,Fare examining the transactions
OL,13,Finvolving Tice's company.
OL,15,FMs Cottrell is the mother of George
OL,16,FCottrell, a convicted criminal who
OL,17,Fprovided funding for Nigel Farage's
OL,18,Fsecurity and staffing in the year
OL,19,Fbefore he was elected.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
