OL,3,CMet Police investigate donations by
OL,4,CRichard Tice company to Reform UK
OL,6,FTice said: "The BBC article is the
OL,7,Ffirst I have heard of it ` if true why
OL,8,Fare the Met Police briefing the BBC
OL,9,Fbefore contacting interested parties?
OL,10,FIs the Met leadership now engaged in
OL,11,Fthe widespread politically motivated
OL,12,Fsmear campaign against Reform and its
OL,13,Fleaders?
OL,15,F"Please remember the National Crime
OL,16,FAgency is now having to investigate
OL,17,Fits own potential criminal offences
OL,18,Fagainst Reform leaders."
OL,26,@nD@LOUwD@AOUzD@XO]
