OL,3,CMet Police investigate donations by
OL,4,CRichard Tice company to Reform UK
OL,6,FA party spokesman said: "Reform takes
OL,7,Fpride in its stringent vetting of
OL,8,Fdonations and always ensures that the
OL,9,FElectoral Commission guidelines on
OL,10,Fdonations, as set out in the Political
OL,11,FParties, Elections and Referendums Act
OL,12,F2000, are strictly followed, as has
OL,13,Fbeen the case with donations so far."
OL,26,@nD@YOUuD@eO]
