OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785111491
OL,3,CMet Police investigate donations by
OL,4,CRichard Tice company to Reform UK
OL,6,FThe Met said two people have so far
OL,7,Fbeen interviewed under caution,
OL,8,Fadding: "An investigation was launched
OL,9,Fin February 2025 after a referral was
OL,10,Fmade to the Metropolitan Police by the
OL,11,FElectoral Commission relating to
OL,12,Fdonations made to a political party
OL,13,Fahead of the 2024 UK general election.
OL,15,F"Detectives from the Met's Special
OL,16,FEnquiry Team are investigating alleged
OL,17,Foffences under Section 61 of the
OL,18,FPolitical Parties, Elections and
OL,19,FReferendums Act 2000.
OL,26,@pD@IOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
