PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785111491
OL,3,CMet Police investigate donations by
OL,4,CRichard Tice company to Reform UK
OL,6,F"Early investigative advice has been
OL,7,Fsought from the Crown Prosecution
OL,8,FService and two people have so far
OL,9,Fbeen interviewed under caution. No
OL,10,Farrests have been made.
OL,12,F"An offence under this section is not
OL,13,Fone that the Electoral Commission can
OL,14,Finvestigate and, as such, it is a
OL,15,Fmatter for the police."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@WO]
