OL,3,CMet Police investigate donations by
OL,4,CRichard Tice company to Reform UK
OL,6,FAsked previously about where Ms
OL,7,FCottrell had got the money from, Tice
OL,8,Fsaid: "I've known the Cottrell family,
OL,9,Fmy family have known the Cottrell
OL,10,Ffamily and the broader Hesketh family,
OL,11,Ffor 50 years.
OL,13,F"A very successful aristocratic
OL,14,Ffamily, and as far as I'm concerned,
OL,15,Fshe's a permissible donor and that's
OL,16,Fthe end of it."
OL,18,FMs Cottrell is said to have no history
OL,19,Fas a political donor.
OL,26,@pD@GOUuD@AOUxD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
