OL,3,CMet Police investigate donations by
OL,4,CRichard Tice company to Reform UK
OL,6,FLeader Nigel Farage has announced he
OL,7,Fwill quit as MP for Clacton to stand
OL,8,Fin the ensuing by-election after
OL,9,Fquestions mounted about a separate #5
OL,10,Fmillion gift he received from crypto-
OL,11,Fbillionaire and party donor
OL,12,FChristopher Harborne.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
